# RabTech Task 02 — Packaged CLI Diagnostics Tool

A small, installable Python command-line tool that inspects a machine and produces a deterministic developer-environment health report.

## Features

- Checks Python version.
- Checks free disk space for a selected path.
- Checks required environment variables.
- Checks configured developer tools available on `PATH`.
- Produces human-readable text or structured JSON.
- Supports a JSON configuration file.
- Uses meaningful exit codes.
- Includes unit tests for success, missing dependency, and malformed configuration.
- Includes sample diagnostic-event data and sample reports.

## Project structure

```text
RabTech-Task-02-Packaged-CLI-Diagnostics/
